    "lines": [
      {
        "id": "line-1",
        "text": "穿上我买给你的衣服",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "bae9ac636b04d1848be9aa9c86759203"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-2",
        "text": "喷上我买给你的香水",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "2a2eb09b129b3fd856a6a79787f8432e"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-3",
        "text": "现在你大概在见她吧",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "d536d22c90108f297b9dc3e2722145b5"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-4",
        "text": "又在那里笑着吧",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "02fe9dd05e607c3fca9b4d1f10f36886"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-5",
        "text": "就有那么好吗",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "77afc552d2244571996cf1d3190107ca"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-6",
        "text": "好到能丢下我离开",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "44711424e158c4d540aa3d1ebadf8e65"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-7",
        "text": "还要多少 要怎么做",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "cb67c8507b65e102399f53904febfe94"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-8",
        "text": "我还得做得更好吗",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "9339641e4a98c30b2b2249108e3b09ca"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-9",
        "text": "不管怎么想把你抹去",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "9c279e4e0ac7e0c44c2b9bb230a6f6da"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-10",
        "text": "一起走过的日子有多少",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "5282c1da8b23b666926b7a368b3b42b3"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-11",
        "text": "过去的时间太委屈",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "6ee7b55b8ebd967a80314d31396b97e2"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-12",
        "text": "眼泪总是止不住地流",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "da454a913bf615076db1f309f161c8e6"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-13",
        "text": "我会让你看到 完全不同的我",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "4d22e0f0d1a5b098acb9483bc198b8c7"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-14",
        "text": "我会让你看到 变得更美的我",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "9cb4be9d8bd058d49ecb8878785ef404"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-15",
        "text": "像傻瓜一样 因为爱而离开的",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "d71d1294c857e8ecc689db624c37940d"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-16",
        "text": "我不会因为你而哭",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "de001c0a242805dbb77428e7727d324c"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-17",
        "text": "我会遇到更帅的男人 一定让你看到",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "8e3f0e7ddd3c207cada4c5cb052f5433"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-18",
        "text": "比你更幸福的我",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "61841b3e651c3d8a13713d32d2db0cd6"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-19",
        "text": "没有你我也不难过 也不会崩溃",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "4eef81e2b0fd42c914d5d7b9309e083d"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-20",
        "text": "boy you gotta be aware",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "6b16ba3372edf16cdddd6e5b54e44952"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-21",
        "text": "清爽地换个发型",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "7d26c270afb25fdf7820741fb00f6fc4"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-22",
        "text": "用心地化好妆",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "f6426789b3510d94f732e22967f02bf8"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-23",
        "text": "高跟鞋配短裙 所有人都回头看我",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "0bb29de4424fb507f6073f209b32a678"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-24",
        "text": "哪怕是偶然遇见你",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "03587a0a4a4bb8d20454ade7be1b0060"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-25",
        "text": "用耀眼灿烂的笑容对我笑",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "cac77d55aefc00c2ff4008d473c1f1b8"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-26",
        "text": "把惊讶的你留在身后",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "85356f71d1a221da41dff03c7b90c2f8"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-27",
        "text": "想要嗒嗒嗒地向前走",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "4a8fddef034e731bab56441e1d0f297a"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-28",
        "text": "会让你看到完全改变的我",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "4d22e0f0d1a5b098acb9483bc198b8c7"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-29",
        "text": "会让你看到更加漂亮的我",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "9cb4be9d8bd058d49ecb8878785ef404"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-30",
        "text": "像傻瓜一样 因为爱情",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "8cfac0d2dd61f55d951a3c43772cf7f2"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-31",
        "text": "不会因为你而哭泣",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "de001c0a242805dbb77428e7727d324c"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-32",
        "text": "会遇见更帅气的男人 一定让你看到",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "8e3f0e7ddd3c207cada4c5cb052f5433"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-33",
        "text": "比你更幸福的我",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "61841b3e651c3d8a13713d32d2db0cd6"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-34",
        "text": "没有你也不悲伤 不会崩溃",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "4eef81e2b0fd42c914d5d7b9309e083d"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-35",
        "text": "boy you gotta be aware",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "6b16ba3372edf16cdddd6e5b54e44952"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-36",
        "text": "丢掉你给过的戒指",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "77857fecf4606ae05531ccd0a9aacd3d"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-37",
        "text": "删掉你写过的信",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "2cfca5ac9f5c410bc4d84260b9740461"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-38",
        "text": "毫无留恋 毫不后悔地忘记你",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "e1416102823615fb60dbd017a0b2588c"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-39",
        "text": "我要忘记你 我要抹去你",
        "source": "ai",
        "sourceHash": "4a78f67e0314c65e023c3214376fcbe6"
      },
      {
        "id": "line-40",
        "text": "会让你看到完全改变的我",
